{"quote_id": "2020-01-17-108473", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-17-108473", "2020-01-20-084011"], "speaker": "Russell Domingo", "quotation": "Where we go and when we go is not our decision. Obviously it would be nice to go once and finish in three weeks, but they think it's best to do it in one-week blocks. I am fine with it,", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-01-21T07:29:07", "query_url": "https://www.dawn.com/news/1529663/bangladesh-can-do-well-in-pakistan-despite-security-concerns", "verbatim": "Russell Domingo said: \"Where we go and when we go is not our decision. Obviously it would be nice to go once and finish in three weeks, but they think it's best to do it in one-week blocks. I am fine with it,\"", "paraphrase": "Russell Domingo said that where and when the team goes is not his decision, and although he would have preferred to go once and finish in three weeks, he is fine with their plan to do it in one-week blocks.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-20T14:45:09", "domain": "news18.com", "url": "https://www.news18.com/cricketnext/news/bangladesh-can-do-well-in-pakistan-despite-security-fears-russell-domingo-2465843.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-20T14:45:09", "domain": "news18.com", "url": "https://www.news18.com/cricketnext/news/bangladesh-can-do-well-in-pakistan-despite-security-fears-russell-domingo-2465843.html"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-06-044682", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-06-044682", "2020-03-05-049144", "2020-03-05-059687"], "speaker": "Gwynne Shotwell", "quotation": "Now, thanks to Axiom and their support from NASA, privately crewed missions will have unprecedented access to the space station, furthering the commercialisation of space and helping usher in a new era of human exploration.", "n_domains": 8, "as_of": "2020-03-06T01:08:20", "query_url": "https://forum.nasaspaceflight.com/index.php?topic=50309.msg2054805#msg2054805", "verbatim": "Gwynne Shotwell said: \"Now, thanks to Axiom and their support from NASA, privately crewed missions will have unprecedented access to the space station, furthering the commercialisation of space and helping usher in a new era of human exploration.\"", "paraphrase": "Shotwell said that, thanks to Axiom and its support from NASA, privately crewed missions would gain unparalleled entry to the orbiting outpost, a step that would accelerate the commercial development of space and help launch a fresh chapter in human exploration.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-05T18:55:00", "domain": "feeds.cbsnews.com", "url": "http://feeds.cbsnews.com/~r/CBSNewsNational/~3/HuWVdK9zfcM/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-05T19:01:01", "domain": "cnbc.com", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2020/03/05/spacex-axiom-deal-to-fly-three-space-tourists-to-iss-in-late-2021.html"}}
