{"quote_id": "2020-02-13-125382", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-13-125382"], "speaker": "Ted-Jan Bloemen", "quotation": "Working toward the Olympics in two years is so far away, so you've got to set goals along the way. This oval for me is really special. I skated two world records here and I thought that might be a possibility again today.", "n_domains": 11, "as_of": "2020-02-13T23:43:20", "query_url": "http://www.recorderonline.com/sports/national_sports/sablikova-bloemen-win-world-speedskating-titles/article_1c03f336-c163-5899-9e95-3896af191a1b.html", "verbatim": "Ted-Jan Bloemen said: \"Working toward the Olympics in two years is so far away, so you've got to set goals along the way. This oval for me is really special. I skated two world records here and I thought that might be a possibility again today.\"", "paraphrase": "Ted-Jan Bloemen said that, with the Olympics two years away, athletes have to set milestones along the way, and that this oval holds special meaning for him because he set two world records there, so he believed another record might be possible again that day.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-13T15:16:00", "domain": "alaskahighwaynews.ca", "url": "http://www.alaskahighwaynews.ca/bloemen-wins-5-000-gold-at-single-distance-speedskating-championships-1.24076090", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-13T15:16:00", "domain": "alaskahighwaynews.ca", "url": "http://www.alaskahighwaynews.ca/bloemen-wins-5-000-gold-at-single-distance-speedskating-championships-1.24076090"}}
