{"quote_id": "2020-03-17-023823", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-17-023823"], "speaker": "Blake Ferguson", "quotation": "I haven't changed anything to be honest. I'm living life the way I usually do. Obviously I have to be careful with my hygiene, but at the end of the day I'll embrace people the way I normally do. I like to be the connection and see where the friendships are at.", "n_domains": 15, "as_of": "2020-03-17T20:09:00", "query_url": "https://www.foxsports.com.au/nrl/nrl-premiership/nrl-2020-coronavirus-news-updates-covid19-todd-greenberg-peter-vlandys-round-2/news-story/7a8328d520082dddac9958471cf60c2d", "verbatim": "Blake Ferguson said: \"I haven't changed anything to be honest. I'm living life the way I usually do. Obviously I have to be careful with my hygiene, but at the end of the day I'll embrace people the way I normally do. I like to be the connection and see where the friendships are at.\"", "paraphrase": "Blake Ferguson said he has not altered anything, adding that he is carrying on with his usual routine while taking care to maintain his personal hygiene, and that he would still greet people as he normally does because he likes to serve as the link between friends and gauge where their friendships stand.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-17T08:46:53", "domain": "smh.com.au", "url": "http://www.smh.com.au/sport/nrl/why-blake-ferguson-was-destined-to-fail-at-following-coronavirus-protocol-20200317-p54b3l.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-17T08:46:53", "domain": "smh.com.au", "url": "http://www.smh.com.au/sport/nrl/why-blake-ferguson-was-destined-to-fail-at-following-coronavirus-protocol-20200317-p54b3l.html"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-03-019019", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-03-019019", "2020-02-06-011954"], "speaker": "Triple H", "quotation": "For the first time in 50 years, the Kansas City @Chiefs can say they are #SuperBowl Champions again! Congratulations to Coach Andy Reid, MVP @PatrickMahomes, @tkelce, and the entire organization. Bring this title back to the #ChiefsKingdom to celebrate!", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-02-04T21:19:35", "query_url": "https://www.kwch.com/content/news/WWE-congratulates-the-Kansas-City-Chiefs-with-title-belt-567561821.html", "verbatim": "Triple H said: \"For the first time in 50 years, the Kansas City @Chiefs can say they are #SuperBowl Champions again! Congratulations to Coach Andy Reid, MVP @PatrickMahomes, @tkelce, and the entire organization. Bring this title back to the #ChiefsKingdom to celebrate!\"", "paraphrase": "Triple H congratulated Coach Andy Reid, MVP Patrick Mahomes, Travis Kelce and the whole Kansas City Chiefs organization, declaring that the franchise had reclaimed the Super Bowl title after a 50-year gap and urging fans to take the trophy back to Chiefs Kingdom to celebrate.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-03T13:34:35", "domain": "wrestlinginc.com", "url": "https://www.WrestlingInc.com/news/2020/02/hhh-sends-custom-wwe-title-to-super-bowl-winners-665855/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-03T13:34:35", "domain": "wrestlinginc.com", "url": "https://www.WrestlingInc.com/news/2020/02/hhh-sends-custom-wwe-title-to-super-bowl-winners-665855/"}}
