{"quote_id": "2020-02-07-018357", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-07-018357", "2020-02-07-018359", "2020-02-07-008102", "2020-02-07-018545"], "speaker": "Borje Ekholm", "quotation": "Ericsson appreciates that GSMA have done everything they can to control the risk. However, as one of the largest exhibitors, Ericsson has thousands of visitors in its hall each day and even if the risk is low, the company cannot guarantee the health and safety of its employees and visitors.", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-02-07T21:59:30", "query_url": "https://medicalxpress.com/news/2020-02-handshakes-tech-virus.html", "verbatim": "Borje Ekholm said: \"Ericsson appreciates that GSMA have done everything they can to control the risk. However, as one of the largest exhibitors, Ericsson has thousands of visitors in its hall each day and even if the risk is low, the company cannot guarantee the health and safety of its employees and visitors.\"", "paraphrase": "Borje Ekholm said Ericsson appreciated that GSMA had taken every possible step to control the risk, but, as one of the largest exhibitors with thousands of visitors passing through its hall each day, the company could not guarantee the health and safety of its employees and visitors even though the risk was low.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-07T12:34:14", "domain": "mobilenewscwp.co.uk", "url": "http://mobilenewscwp.co.uk/Manufacturers/article/ericsson-withdraws-mwc-2020-amid-coronavirus-worries", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-07T12:34:14", "domain": "mobilenewscwp.co.uk", "url": "http://mobilenewscwp.co.uk/Manufacturers/article/ericsson-withdraws-mwc-2020-amid-coronavirus-worries"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-29-003850", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-29-003850"], "speaker": "Danny Price", "quotation": "Bernie is a socialist, or a communist, and he wants to give everybody free stuff. For a lot of people, that sounds exciting, but they just don't understand who's going to pay for it,", "n_domains": 9, "as_of": "2020-02-29T09:00:04", "query_url": "http://baytoday.ca/national-news/air-force-one-swoops-into-south-carolina-as-voters-head-to-the-polls-2128723", "verbatim": "Danny Price said: \"Bernie is a socialist, or a communist, and he wants to give everybody free stuff. For a lot of people, that sounds exciting, but they just don't understand who's going to pay for it,\"", "paraphrase": "Danny Price said that Bernie was a socialist or a communist who wanted to hand out free stuff to everyone, and that while this sounded appealing to many people, they did not grasp who would foot the bill.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-29T01:00:00", "domain": "alaskahighwaynews.ca", "url": "http://www.alaskahighwaynews.ca/air-force-one-swoops-into-south-carolina-as-voters-head-to-the-polls-1.24087321", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-29T01:00:00", "domain": "alaskahighwaynews.ca", "url": "http://www.alaskahighwaynews.ca/air-force-one-swoops-into-south-carolina-as-voters-head-to-the-polls-1.24087321"}}
