{"quote_id": "2020-01-20-064816", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-20-064816", "2020-01-20-086543", "2020-01-20-081688", "2020-01-20-064919", "2020-01-20-086542", "2020-01-20-086933", "2020-01-20-000373", "2020-01-21-108238", "2020-01-20-086544", "2020-01-21-044515"], "speaker": "Jennifer Aniston", "quotation": "There are dark hours... or, not dark hours, but you don't really have that much of a life. So it's nice to come out, put a pretty dress on and sort of celebrate your friends and their work and inspire each other to keep going.", "n_domains": 29, "as_of": "2020-01-20T08:57:53", "query_url": "https://www.eonline.com/news/1113913/why-jennifer-aniston-says-she-ll-never-forget-the-2020-sag-awards?cmpid=rss-000000-rssfeed-365-topstories&utm_source=eonline&utm_medium=rssfeeds&utm_campaign=rss_topstories", "verbatim": "Jennifer Aniston said: \"There are dark hours... or, not dark hours, but you don't really have that much of a life. So it's nice to come out, put a pretty dress on and sort of celebrate your friends and their work and inspire each other to keep going.\"", "paraphrase": "Jennifer Aniston said that there are times when, or rather not dark times but periods when people don't have much of a social life, so it is pleasant to go out, dress up and celebrate friends and their work while encouraging one another to keep pushing forward.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-20T01:17:56", "domain": "eonline.com", "url": "https://www.eonline.com/news/1113749/jennifer-aniston-reacts-to-brad-pitt-watching-her-2020-sag-awards-win?cmpid=rss-000000-rssfeed-365-topstories&utm_source=eonline&utm_medium=rssfeeds&utm_campaign=rss_topstories", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-20T01:17:56", "domain": "eonline.com", "url": "https://www.eonline.com/news/1113749/jennifer-aniston-reacts-to-brad-pitt-watching-her-2020-sag-awards-win?cmpid=rss-000000-rssfeed-365-topstories&utm_source=eonline&utm_medium=rssfeeds&utm_campaign=rss_topstories"}}
