{"quote_id": "2020-03-02-061155", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-02-061155"], "speaker": "Bruno Le Maire", "quotation": "There will be a concerted action. Yesterday, I spoke with the G-7 president, the US Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin, and this week we will have a meeting by phone of the finance G-7 ministers to coordinate our responses,", "n_domains": 10, "as_of": "2020-03-02T15:54:32", "query_url": "http://channelnewsasia.com/news/world/g7-to-take-concerted-action-to-limit-coronavirus-growth-hit-12491148", "verbatim": "Bruno Le Maire said: \"There will be a concerted action. Yesterday, I spoke with the G-7 president, the US Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin, and this week we will have a meeting by phone of the finance G-7 ministers to coordinate our responses,\"", "paraphrase": "French Finance Minister Bruno Le Maire said that concerted action would be taken, adding that he had spoken the previous day with US Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin and that G-7 finance ministers would hold a phone meeting later that week to coordinate their responses.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-02T07:24:25", "domain": "businesstimes.com.sg", "url": "http://www.businesstimes.com.sg/government-economy/g-7-finance-ministers-to-discuss-coronavirus-this-week", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-02T07:24:25", "domain": "businesstimes.com.sg", "url": "http://www.businesstimes.com.sg/government-economy/g-7-finance-ministers-to-discuss-coronavirus-this-week"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-12-052429", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-12-052429", "2020-02-13-091086"], "speaker": "Chuck Schumer", "quotation": "It sends a shot across his bow that the majority of the Senate and the majority of the House do not want the President waging war without congressional approval,", "n_domains": 13, "as_of": "2020-02-12T18:36:25", "query_url": "https://localnews8.com/news/2020/02/12/senate-to-debate-iran-war-powers-resolution-ahead-of-expected-vote/", "verbatim": "Chuck Schumer said: \"It sends a shot across his bow that the majority of the Senate and the majority of the House do not want the President waging war without congressional approval,\"", "paraphrase": "Schumer said it sent a clear warning to the president that most lawmakers in both chambers of Congress oppose launching military action absent congressional authorization.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-12T12:01:31", "domain": "rss.cnn.com", "url": "http://rss.cnn.com/~r/rss/cnn_allpolitics/~3/I1Ijm1m7UAg/index.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-12T12:01:31", "domain": "abc17news.com", "url": "https://abc17news.com/news/politics/national-politics/2020/02/12/senate-to-debate-iran-war-powers-resolution-ahead-of-expected-vote/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-14-069158", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-14-069158"], "speaker": "Mark Zandi", "quotation": "That is going from 2% growth to 1\u00a03/4% growth. Over a period of a generation, that would make it harder to provide for a lot of the things he wants to provide.", "n_domains": 7, "as_of": "2020-01-14T17:06:08", "query_url": "https://abc17news.com/news/politics/national-politics/2020/01/14/the-cost-of-sanders-agenda-would-set-a-peacetime-us-record/", "verbatim": "Mark Zandi said: \"That is going from 2% growth to 1\u00a03/4% growth. Over a period of a generation, that would make it harder to provide for a lot of the things he wants to provide.\"", "paraphrase": "Mark Zandi said that the slowdown from 2% growth to 1.75% would, over the span of a generation, make it harder to pay for many of the things the government wants to fund.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-14T11:06:08", "domain": "rss.cnn.com", "url": "http://rss.cnn.com/~r/rss/cnn_topstories/~3/KeZ02GTeiBM/index.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": null}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-31-075559", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-31-075559", "2020-01-31-066662", "2020-02-01-019679"], "speaker": "Justine Henin", "quotation": "She's had lots of ups and downs for sure but she's a girl who has the potential to play semi-finals and finals everywhere.", "n_domains": 15, "as_of": "2020-01-31T13:46:29", "query_url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/news/sport/grand-slam-experience-has-muguruza-primed-for-title---henin-12373338?cid=cna_flip_070214", "verbatim": "Justine Henin said: \"She's had lots of ups and downs for sure but she's a girl who has the potential to play semi-finals and finals everywhere.\"", "paraphrase": "Justine Henin said the player had experienced considerable highs and lows, but added that she had the capacity to reach the last four and championship matches on any surface.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-31T05:43:54", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/jan/31/grand-slam-experience-has-muguruza-primed-for-title-henin/980309/?refer-section=sports", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-31T05:43:54", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/jan/31/grand-slam-experience-has-muguruza-primed-for-title-henin/980309/?refer-section=sports"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-04-02-037297", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-04-02-037297", "2020-04-03-035968"], "speaker": "Eleanor Riley", "quotation": "It's not something that we've ever done before. When we vaccinate people, particularly for certain diseases where they're going to travel overseas... we give people a certificate saying they have been vaccinated,", "n_domains": 23, "as_of": "2020-04-02T21:23:09", "query_url": "https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/news/uk-world-news/coronavirus-immunity-certificates-branded-dangerous-21804256", "verbatim": "Eleanor Riley said: \"It's not something that we've ever done before. When we vaccinate people, particularly for certain diseases where they're going to travel overseas... we give people a certificate saying they have been vaccinated,\"", "paraphrase": "Eleanor Riley said the approach was unprecedented for the organisation, explaining that when staff immunise people, particularly against diseases that travellers may pick up overseas, they issue each person a certificate confirming the vaccination.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-04-02T13:00:00", "domain": "coffscoastadvocate.com.au", "url": "https://www.coffscoastadvocate.com.au/news/immunity-certificates-would-be-dangerous/3988242/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-04-02T13:00:00", "domain": "coffscoastadvocate.com.au", "url": "https://www.coffscoastadvocate.com.au/news/immunity-certificates-would-be-dangerous/3988242/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-17-010146", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-17-010146", "2020-03-20-078601", "2020-03-18-010451", "2020-03-18-010699", "2020-03-18-010450", "2020-03-31-040182"], "speaker": "Kristian Andersen", "quotation": "By comparing the available genome sequence data for known coronavirus strains, we can firmly determine that SARS-CoV-2 originated through natural processes.", "n_domains": 46, "as_of": "2020-03-18T05:17:32", "query_url": "http://aninews.in/news/health/coronavirus-has-a-natural-origin-says-study20200318104732", "verbatim": "Kristian Andersen said: \"By comparing the available genome sequence data for known coronavirus strains, we can firmly determine that SARS-CoV-2 originated through natural processes.\"", "paraphrase": "Kristian Andersen said that by comparing existing genome sequence data from known coronavirus strains, scientists could conclusively establish that SARS-CoV-2 arose through natural processes.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-17T22:05:36", "domain": "eurasiareview.com", "url": "https://www.eurasiareview.com/17032020-covid-19-coronavirus-epidemic-has-a-natural-origin/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-17T22:05:36", "domain": "eurasiareview.com", "url": "https://www.eurasiareview.com/17032020-covid-19-coronavirus-epidemic-has-a-natural-origin/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-02-002413", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-02-002413"], "speaker": "Michel Barnier", "quotation": "And at the same time, in this trade agreement, we want an agreement on the level playing field,", "n_domains": 11, "as_of": "2020-02-03T03:01:13", "query_url": "http://www.ibtimes.com/next-brexit-battle-begins-over-future-ties-2914442", "verbatim": "Michel Barnier said: \"And at the same time, in this trade agreement, we want an agreement on the level playing field,\"", "paraphrase": "Michel Barnier said that the trade agreement also had to secure a deal ensuring equal competitive conditions for both sides.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-02T19:18:07", "domain": "breitbart.com", "url": "http://www.breitbart.com/news/next-brexit-battle-begins-over-future-ties/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-02T19:18:07", "domain": "breitbart.com", "url": "http://www.breitbart.com/news/next-brexit-battle-begins-over-future-ties/"}}
