{"quote_id": "2020-02-03-047475", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-03-047475", "2020-02-04-052821", "2020-02-03-047474", "2020-02-03-048810"], "speaker": "Li Shuwei", "quotation": "It's impossible to predict how this disease will develop. Even the experts have no clear idea when the outbreak will end, let alone stock traders. It's too early to buy stocks right now and it's also difficult to sell as all shares are limit down. So I will just have to wait and see.", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-02-03T09:21:22", "query_url": "https://www.rt.com/business/479929-china-markets-plunge-coronavirus/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=RSS", "verbatim": "Li Shuwei said: \"It's impossible to predict how this disease will develop. Even the experts have no clear idea when the outbreak will end, let alone stock traders. It's too early to buy stocks right now and it's also difficult to sell as all shares are limit down. So I will just have to wait and see.\"", "paraphrase": "Li Shuwei said predicting how the illness would progress was impossible, adding that specialists had no clear sense of when the outbreak would finish, much less investors, and that buying shares was premature while selling was hard because every share had hit its daily floor, so he would simply hold off and watch how things unfold.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-03T03:09:00", "domain": "msn.com", "url": "http://msn.com/en-au/money/markets/chinese-stocks-sink-9percent-as-markets-reopen-to-crisis-after-break/ar-BBZAkvY?li=AAgfOd8", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-03T03:48:06", "domain": "thepage.time.com", "url": "http://thepage.time.com/5776558/chinese-stocks-plunge-coronavirus-outbreak/"}}
