{"quote_id": "2020-01-27-093007", "split": "train", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-27-093007", "2020-01-28-099768"], "speaker": "Bryan Smith", "quotation": "We were able to marry a groundbreaking finding in atherosclerosis by our collaborators with the state-of-the-art selectivity and delivery capabilities of our advanced nanomaterial platform. We demonstrated the nanomaterials were able to selectively seek out and deliver a message to the very cells needed,", "n_domains": 6, "as_of": "2020-01-28T07:21:50", "query_url": "https://phys.org/news/2020-01-nanoparticle-chomps-plaques-heart.html", "verbatim": "Bryan Smith said: \"We were able to marry a groundbreaking finding in atherosclerosis by our collaborators with the state-of-the-art selectivity and delivery capabilities of our advanced nanomaterial platform. We demonstrated the nanomaterials were able to selectively seek out and deliver a message to the very cells needed,\"", "paraphrase": "Bryan Smith said the team had paired a breakthrough discovery about atherosclerosis made by its collaborators with the cutting-edge targeting and delivery strengths of its advanced nanomaterial platform, and showed that the nanomaterials could selectively home in on and carry a message to precisely the cells that required it.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-27T05:00:00", "domain": "eurekalert.org", "url": "https://www.eurekalert.org/pub_releases/2020-01/msu-nca012720.php", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-27T05:00:00", "domain": "eurekalert.org", "url": "https://www.eurekalert.org/pub_releases/2020-01/msu-nca012720.php"}}
