{"quote_id": "2020-03-21-010576", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-21-010576", "2020-03-20-031816"], "speaker": "Paul Casey", "quotation": "I am never a fan of postponing stuff but it's been postponed before, so why can't it happen again?", "n_domains": 13, "as_of": "2020-03-21T07:04:00", "query_url": "https://www.oann.com/golf-casey-backs-postponement-of-ryder-cup-because-of-coronavirus/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=golf-casey-backs-postponement-of-ryder-cup-because-of-coronavirus", "verbatim": "Paul Casey said: \"I am never a fan of postponing stuff but it's been postponed before, so why can't it happen again?\"", "paraphrase": "Paul Casey said he disliked delaying things, but since the event had already been pushed back once before, he asked why it could not happen again.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-20T21:50:25", "domain": "golfchannel.com", "url": "http://www.golfchannel.com/news/paul-casey-supports-fall-majors-possible-ryder-cup-postponement", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-20T21:50:25", "domain": "golfchannel.com", "url": "http://www.golfchannel.com/news/paul-casey-supports-fall-majors-possible-ryder-cup-postponement"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-19-104644", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-19-104644", "2020-02-20-018017", "2020-02-26-090599", "2020-02-19-104643", "2020-02-20-090551", "2020-02-19-005827", "2020-02-20-093835", "2020-02-20-092474"], "speaker": "Mike Bloomberg", "quotation": "What happened, however, was it got out of control and when we discovered-I discovered - that we were doing many, many, too many stop and frisks, we cut 95% of them out.", "n_domains": 7, "as_of": "2020-02-20T03:31:00", "query_url": "https://wtop.com/news/2020/02/ap-fact-check-examining-claims-from-the-democratic-debate-2/", "verbatim": "Mike Bloomberg said: \"What happened, however, was it got out of control and when we discovered-I discovered - that we were doing many, many, too many stop and frisks, we cut 95% of them out.\"", "paraphrase": "Bloomberg said that the program had gotten out of hand, and that when he realized it was being used far too often, he had personally discovered the excess and cut stop-and-frisk encounters by 95 percent.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-19T20:54:37", "domain": "nbclosangeles.com", "url": "https://www.nbclosangeles.com/news/local/ap-fact-check-dems-debate-flubs-trump-untruths-at-rally/2312663/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-19T20:54:37", "domain": "nbclosangeles.com", "url": "https://www.nbclosangeles.com/news/local/ap-fact-check-dems-debate-flubs-trump-untruths-at-rally/2312663/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-21-044376", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-21-044376"], "speaker": "Scott Morrison", "quotation": "What we can provide certainty of is that if somebody finds himself in a position where they have lost their job, I have doubled the jobseeker payment,", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-03-22T11:22:10", "query_url": "http://www.centraltelegraph.com.au/news/pm-warns-aussies-as-virus-lockdown-looms/3978619/", "verbatim": "Scott Morrison said: \"What we can provide certainty of is that if somebody finds himself in a position where they have lost their job, I have doubled the jobseeker payment,\"", "paraphrase": "Scott Morrison said that anyone who has lost their job can be certain that he had doubled the jobseeker payment.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-21T13:00:00", "domain": "dailyexaminer.com.au", "url": "https://www.dailyexaminer.com.au/news/pm-warns-aussies-as-virus-lockdown-looms/3978619/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-21T13:00:00", "domain": "dailyexaminer.com.au", "url": "https://www.dailyexaminer.com.au/news/pm-warns-aussies-as-virus-lockdown-looms/3978619/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-31-063026", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-31-063026", "2020-04-01-067700"], "speaker": "Monica Puig", "quotation": "Trying to see what other athletes are up to -- I've seen some people getting very creative with their home workouts, doing different things when you don't have dumbbells,", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-04-01T03:07:03", "query_url": "https://www.firstpost.com/sports/coronavirus-outbreak-trying-to-find-ways-to-stay-active-stay-happy-says-olympic-champion-monica-puig-on-dealing-with-quarantine-8213611.html", "verbatim": "Monica Puig said: \"Trying to see what other athletes are up to -- I've seen some people getting very creative with their home workouts, doing different things when you don't have dumbbells,\"", "paraphrase": "Monica Puig said she has been keeping tabs on what fellow athletes are doing and has noticed that some people have become highly inventive in home training, switching up exercises when they lack dumbbells.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-31T17:48:22", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/mar/31/olympic-champion-puig-finding-new-normal-with-games-delay/1001492/?refer-section=sports", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-31T17:48:22", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/mar/31/olympic-champion-puig-finding-new-normal-with-games-delay/1001492/?refer-section=sports"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-04-003953", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-04-003953"], "speaker": "Jerome Powell", "quotation": "and that's one of the reasons we have come to the view that it would be appropriate for us today to move to support the economy, and that's what we have done,", "n_domains": 28, "as_of": "2020-03-04T20:09:18", "query_url": "http://brooklyn.news12.com/story/41853354/fed-survey-finds-coronavirus-impacting-parts-of-us-economy", "verbatim": "Jerome Powell said: \"and that's one of the reasons we have come to the view that it would be appropriate for us today to move to support the economy, and that's what we have done,\"", "paraphrase": "Jerome Powell said that one reason the Fed had concluded it was fitting to act that day to bolster the economy, and the central bank had taken exactly that step.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-04T14:07:15", "domain": "nbcsandiego.com", "url": "https://www.nbcsandiego.com/news/coronavirus/fed-survey-finds-coronavirus-impacting-parts-of-us-economy/2278619/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-04T14:07:15", "domain": "nbcsandiego.com", "url": "https://www.nbcsandiego.com/news/coronavirus/fed-survey-finds-coronavirus-impacting-parts-of-us-economy/2278619/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-26-055256", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-26-055256"], "speaker": "Bernie Sanders", "quotation": "When I was mayor, we significantly expanded our police force and we provided stronger law enforcement, and at the same time, we developed a number of crime prevention programs. Programs designed to give young people especially... the opportunity to do something else with their lives rather than turn to drugs and self-destruction and crime.", "n_domains": 6, "as_of": "2020-01-26T21:58:38", "query_url": "https://abc17news.com/news/politics/national-politics/2020/01/26/bernie-sanders-said-country-needed-more-jails-and-tougher-penalties-in-certain-cases-in-1994-remarks-backing-crime-bill/", "verbatim": "Bernie Sanders said: \"When I was mayor, we significantly expanded our police force and we provided stronger law enforcement, and at the same time, we developed a number of crime prevention programs. Programs designed to give young people especially... the opportunity to do something else with their lives rather than turn to drugs and self-destruction and crime.\"", "paraphrase": "Bernie Sanders said that during his time as mayor the city significantly expanded its police force and strengthened law enforcement while also developing a number of crime prevention programs, especially ones aimed at giving young people the chance to pursue alternatives to drugs, self-destruction and crime.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-26T15:58:38", "domain": "rss.cnn.com", "url": "http://rss.cnn.com/~r/rss/cnn_topstories/~3/3oAogBGL5Qo/index.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-26T16:09:20", "domain": "whdh.com", "url": "https://whdh.com/news/bernie-sanders-said-country-needed-more-jails-and-tougher-penalties-in-certain-cases-in-1994-remarks-backing-crime-bill/"}}
