{"quote_id": "2020-01-20-031971", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-20-031971", "2020-01-20-031972", "2020-01-21-085538"], "speaker": "Richard Peck", "quotation": "In a typical case, double criminality is not contentious. This case, however, is founded on an allegation of breach of U.S. sanctions, sanctions which Canada has expressly repudiated,", "n_domains": 9, "as_of": "2020-01-20T19:12:00", "query_url": "https://calgaryherald.com/pmn/business-pmn/huawei-cfo-mengs-lawyer-says-double-criminality-at-center-of-u-s-extradition-case/wcm/b576e3f9-1728-4abc-bddf-67dcee14496d", "verbatim": "Richard Peck said: \"In a typical case, double criminality is not contentious. This case, however, is founded on an allegation of breach of U.S. sanctions, sanctions which Canada has expressly repudiated,\"", "paraphrase": "Richard Peck said that while double criminality is typically uncontroversial, this case rests on an accusation of breaching American sanctions, which Canada has explicitly rejected.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-20T12:25:12", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/jan/20/meng-wanzhous-freedom-on-trial-as-china-us-clash-plays-out-in-canada-court/976311/?refer-section=technology", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-20T12:25:12", "domain": "wsau.com", "url": "https://wsau.com/news/articles/2020/jan/20/meng-wanzhous-freedom-on-trial-as-china-us-clash-plays-out-in-canada-court/976311/?refer-section=technology"}}
