{"quote_id": "2020-03-17-035627", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-17-035627", "2020-03-19-095107"], "speaker": "Dale Steyn", "quotation": "It just seems like it is the only topic of conversation. Any WhatsApp groups that I'm part of, it's really tough to escape. Normally if I am on holiday I'll be planning a fishing trip or a surfing trip. At the moment I am just chilling at home,", "n_domains": 11, "as_of": "2020-03-19T16:30:23", "query_url": "http://www.outlookindia.com/website/story/one-thing-that-brings-everybody-together-is-sport-pity-everything-is-blocked-off-dale-steyn-on-covid-19-impact/349102", "verbatim": "Dale Steyn said: \"It just seems like it is the only topic of conversation. Any WhatsApp groups that I'm part of, it's really tough to escape. Normally if I am on holiday I'll be planning a fishing trip or a surfing trip. At the moment I am just chilling at home,\"", "paraphrase": "Steyn said the subject seemed to be the only topic people wanted to discuss, making it hard to avoid in the WhatsApp groups he belonged to, and that while he would normally spend a holiday organising fishing or surfing trips, he was currently just relaxing at home.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-19T07:15:00", "domain": "timesofindia.indiatimes.com", "url": "http://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/news/pity-everything-is-blocked-off-dale-steyn-on-covid-19-impact-on-sports/articleshow/74706937.cms", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-19T07:15:00", "domain": "timesofindia.indiatimes.com", "url": "http://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/news/pity-everything-is-blocked-off-dale-steyn-on-covid-19-impact-on-sports/articleshow/74706937.cms"}}
