{"quote_id": "2020-02-10-040917", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-10-040917"], "speaker": "Vlatko Andonovski", "quotation": "In the first half, throughout the whole game, they were very organized, very disciplined. They're one of the best teams in the world, top 10 in the world, so it's not going to be easy, if you sit back it will be really hard,", "n_domains": 9, "as_of": "2020-02-10T17:52:00", "query_url": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/us-womens-soccer-team-beats-canada-in-olympic-qualifying-final-2020-02-10?mod=mw_latestnews", "verbatim": "Vlatko Andonovski said: \"In the first half, throughout the whole game, they were very organized, very disciplined. They're one of the best teams in the world, top 10 in the world, so it's not going to be easy, if you sit back it will be really hard,\"", "paraphrase": "Vlatko Andonovski said the opponent had been well-organized and disciplined for the entire match, adding that it was among the world's elite, ranked inside the top 10, so the game would not be easy and a passive approach would make it especially tough.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-10T01:42:26", "domain": "arkansasonline.com", "url": "http://www.arkansasonline.com/news/2020/feb/10/scoreless-standoff-turns-into-another-u-1/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-10T01:42:26", "domain": "arkansasonline.com", "url": "http://www.arkansasonline.com/news/2020/feb/10/scoreless-standoff-turns-into-another-u-1/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-07-089363", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-07-089363", "2020-01-07-084076"], "speaker": "Justin Langer", "quotation": "We've been able to keep the guys together. We've obviously got an excellent fast bowling attack, we've got the best off-spinner in the world (Nathan Lyon), we've got two of the best batsmen who have played for Australia (David Warner and Steve Smith) and... Tim Paine is the best wicketkeeper in the world,", "n_domains": 7, "as_of": "2020-01-08T09:04:07", "query_url": "http://www.mid-day.com/articles/no-india-tour-for-rested-justin-langer/22392156?from=home-sports", "verbatim": "Justin Langer said: \"We've been able to keep the guys together. We've obviously got an excellent fast bowling attack, we've got the best off-spinner in the world (Nathan Lyon), we've got two of the best batsmen who have played for Australia (David Warner and Steve Smith) and... Tim Paine is the best wicketkeeper in the world,\"", "paraphrase": "Justin Langer said the team had managed to keep the players together, pointing to an excellent fast bowling attack, the world's best off-spinner in Nathan Lyon, two of the finest batsmen to have played for Australia in David Warner and Steve Smith, and Tim Paine, whom he described as the best wicketkeeper in the world.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-07T05:13:11", "domain": "aninews.in", "url": "http://aninews.in/news/sports/cricket/still-working-towards-having-a-great-cricket-team-justin-langer20200107104153/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-07T06:39:51", "domain": "freepressjournal.in", "url": "https://www.freepressjournal.in/sports/aussie-coach-justin-langer-takes-break-from-australia-tour-of-india-andrew-mcdonald-to-lead-visitors"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-04-01-037275", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-04-01-037275", "2020-04-02-026035"], "speaker": "Eoin Morgan", "quotation": "I've played county cricket for a long time and Test match cricket in Dubai and Abu Dhabi, and that's the exact same, I'd say,", "n_domains": 11, "as_of": "2020-04-02T00:30:10", "query_url": "http://dunyanews.tv/index.php/en/Cricket/539264-Morgan-says-England-could-field-two-cricket-teams-at-same-time", "verbatim": "Eoin Morgan said: \"I've played county cricket for a long time and Test match cricket in Dubai and Abu Dhabi, and that's the exact same, I'd say,\"", "paraphrase": "Eoin Morgan said he had played county cricket for years and Test cricket in Dubai as well as Abu Dhabi, and that the two were, in his view, exactly identical.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-04-01T18:26:00", "domain": "barkinganddagenhampost.co.uk", "url": "https://www.barkinganddagenhampost.co.uk/morgan-happy-to-play-behind-closed-doors-1-6589973", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-04-01T18:26:00", "domain": "barkinganddagenhampost.co.uk", "url": "https://www.barkinganddagenhampost.co.uk/morgan-happy-to-play-behind-closed-doors-1-6589973"}}
