{"quote_id": "2020-01-09-051199", "split": "val", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-09-051199", "2020-01-11-025518", "2020-01-12-024367", "2020-01-10-098154", "2020-01-09-051200", "2020-01-12-024246"], "speaker": "Deshaun Watson", "quotation": "It's going to be a good experience. Like you said, we played earlier this year. It was a good game, went back and forth. But yeah, it's just two good teams going head to head, and we're just trying to be the best we can for our team and help our team win.", "n_domains": 10, "as_of": "2020-01-09T23:16:00", "query_url": "http://www.columbiamissourian.com/sports/pro_sports/watson-vs-mahomes-headlines-texans-chiefs-playoff-tilt/article_3e4620f0-1307-589f-b024-de441014a041.html", "verbatim": "Deshaun Watson said: \"It's going to be a good experience. Like you said, we played earlier this year. It was a good game, went back and forth. But yeah, it's just two good teams going head to head, and we're just trying to be the best we can for our team and help our team win.\"", "paraphrase": "Deshaun Watson said he expected the game to be a positive experience, noting that the teams had faced each other earlier this season in a close contest that swung back and forth, and that with two strong teams meeting head to head, he and his teammates were focused on doing their best to help the team win.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-09T15:16:54", "domain": "seattletimes.com", "url": "https://www.seattletimes.com/sports/watson-vs-mahomes-headlines-texans-chiefs-playoff-tilt/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=RSS_all", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-09T15:16:54", "domain": "seattletimes.com", "url": "https://www.seattletimes.com/sports/watson-vs-mahomes-headlines-texans-chiefs-playoff-tilt/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=RSS_all"}}
