{"quote_id": "2020-03-21-032623", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-21-032623"], "speaker": "Darren Taylor", "quotation": "The problem is we're having sponsors pull out due to either financial problems themselves or because there's no sport going ahead. They (don't know) what they're getting for their money. Ethan Long, 16, Division 10 candidate Darren Taylor, Indiana McDonald, 10, and Broadbeach Soccer Club Juniors director Campbell Black. Picture: Jerad Williams", "n_domains": 15, "as_of": "2020-03-22T00:31:34", "query_url": "http://www.centraltelegraph.com.au/news/call-to-freeze-rates-for-sports-clubs-during-crisi/3977791/", "verbatim": "Darren Taylor said: \"The problem is we're having sponsors pull out due to either financial problems themselves or because there's no sport going ahead. They (don't know) what they're getting for their money. Ethan Long, 16, Division 10 candidate Darren Taylor, Indiana McDonald, 10, and Broadbeach Soccer Club Juniors director Campbell Black. Picture: Jerad Williams\"", "paraphrase": "Darren Taylor said the main problem is that sponsors are withdrawing because of their own financial difficulties or because no sport is going ahead, and that they do not understand what they are getting for their money.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-21T13:31:34", "domain": "northernstar.com.au", "url": "http://northernstar.com.au/news/call-to-freeze-rates-for-sports-clubs-during-crisi/3977791/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-21T13:31:34", "domain": "northernstar.com.au", "url": "http://northernstar.com.au/news/call-to-freeze-rates-for-sports-clubs-during-crisi/3977791/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-04-01-082369", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-04-01-082369", "2020-04-02-065397", "2020-04-02-086430", "2020-04-02-035844", "2020-04-01-062938", "2020-04-02-074662", "2020-04-01-073153"], "speaker": "President Donald Trump", "quotation": "You can understand you have people that are sick on the ships and states don't want to take (them). They have enough problems right now. They don't want to take them. But we have to from a humane standpoint. We don't have a choice. I don't want to do that but we have to. People are dying.", "n_domains": 13, "as_of": "2020-04-02T01:32:08", "query_url": "http://baytoday.ca/national-news/donald-trump-says-canadians-on-two-stranded-cruise-ships-will-be-heading-home-2217182", "verbatim": "President Donald Trump said: \"You can understand you have people that are sick on the ships and states don't want to take (them). They have enough problems right now. They don't want to take them. But we have to from a humane standpoint. We don't have a choice. I don't want to do that but we have to. People are dying.\"", "paraphrase": "President Donald Trump said that states were reluctant to take in people who were sick aboard the ships and already had enough problems, but that the government had to do so on humanitarian grounds because people were dying, even though he did not want to do it.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-04-01T15:35:00", "domain": "cp24.com", "url": "https://www.cp24.com/news/donald-trump-says-canadians-on-two-stranded-cruise-ships-will-be-heading-home-1.4877506", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-04-01T15:35:00", "domain": "cp24.com", "url": "https://www.cp24.com/news/donald-trump-says-canadians-on-two-stranded-cruise-ships-will-be-heading-home-1.4877506"}}
