{"quote_id": "2020-01-23-066131", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-23-066131", "2020-01-22-065945"], "speaker": "David Quinn", "quotation": "One of the things we talked about in between the first and second period was: `Don't play the score. If you do the right thing over and over again, the game will reward you, '", "n_domains": 6, "as_of": "2020-01-23T07:41:28", "query_url": "http://www.yumasun.com/sports/national_sports/most-dangerous-lead-in-hockey-this-season-it-s-all/article_c7d7d06d-98f3-5d8e-878e-52efcfc32f6d.html", "verbatim": "David Quinn said: \"One of the things we talked about in between the first and second period was: `Don't play the score. If you do the right thing over and over again, the game will reward you, '\"", "paraphrase": "Quinn said that during the break before the second period, the team discussed not chasing the scoreboard, adding that continuing to make the correct decisions would eventually be rewarded by the game.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-22T23:41:28", "domain": "seattletimes.com", "url": "https://www.seattletimes.com/sports/hockey/most-dangerous-lead-in-hockey-this-season-its-all-of-them/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=RSS_all", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-22T23:41:28", "domain": "seattletimes.com", "url": "https://www.seattletimes.com/sports/hockey/most-dangerous-lead-in-hockey-this-season-its-all-of-them/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=RSS_all"}}
