{"quote_id": "2020-01-30-086350", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-30-086350", "2020-01-31-083954"], "speaker": "Humberto Mestre", "quotation": "The double hit of the spreading depolarization and the ischemia makes the blood vessels cramp, resulting in a level of constriction that is completely abnormal and creating conditions for CSF to rapidly flow into the brain.", "n_domains": 7, "as_of": "2020-01-30T19:00:07", "query_url": "https://medicalxpress.com/news/2020-01-brain-fluid.html", "verbatim": "Humberto Mestre said: \"The double hit of the spreading depolarization and the ischemia makes the blood vessels cramp, resulting in a level of constriction that is completely abnormal and creating conditions for CSF to rapidly flow into the brain.\"", "paraphrase": "Humberto Mestre said that pairing spreading depolarization with ischemia causes blood vessels to tighten to an abnormally extreme degree, which lets cerebrospinal fluid pour rapidly into the brain.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-30T05:00:00", "domain": "eurekalert.org", "url": "https://www.eurekalert.org/pub_releases/2020-01/uorm-bdi012820.php", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-30T05:00:00", "domain": "eurekalert.org", "url": "https://www.eurekalert.org/pub_releases/2020-01/uorm-bdi012820.php"}}
