{"quote_id": "2020-01-24-032626", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-24-032626", "2020-01-30-035911"], "speaker": "Margot Robbie", "quotation": "I love stunt work, so I really, really love it. It's just cool to work with an amazing stunt team like 87 Eleven. They're truly amazing, like, backflips, that's Renae Moneymaker. She's an incredible stunt performer. But yeah, they got me doing everything else really, other than critical acrobats, so it was fun,", "n_domains": 10, "as_of": "2020-01-30T12:10:00", "query_url": "https://www.msn.com/en-us/movies/celebrity/margot-robbie-on-pulling-off-her-own-stunts-in-birds-of-prey-exclusive/ar-BBZsUKd?srcref=rss", "verbatim": "Margot Robbie said: \"I love stunt work, so I really, really love it. It's just cool to work with an amazing stunt team like 87 Eleven. They're truly amazing, like, backflips, that's Renae Moneymaker. She's an incredible stunt performer. But yeah, they got me doing everything else really, other than critical acrobats, so it was fun,\"", "paraphrase": "Margot Robbie said she enjoyed stunt work immensely and praised the 87 Eleven team as truly remarkable, singling out Renae Moneymaker as an incredible performer for backflips, and added that the team had her doing nearly everything else apart from the most demanding acrobatics, which she found enjoyable.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-30T04:59:15", "domain": "etonline.com", "url": "http://etonline.com/margot-robbie-on-pulling-off-her-own-stunts-in-birds-of-prey-exclusive-140578", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-30T04:59:15", "domain": "etonline.com", "url": "http://etonline.com/margot-robbie-on-pulling-off-her-own-stunts-in-birds-of-prey-exclusive-140578"}}
