{"quote_id": "2020-04-01-004177", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-04-01-004177"], "speaker": "Daniel Brenner", "quotation": "and there's really no consensus across the country or the medical community which approach is right yet because this disease has only been studied for two months,", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-04-02T03:07:00", "query_url": "http://wap.business-standard.com/article/international/making-the-right-call-is-crucial-us-doctor-on-treating-coronavirus-120040200206_1.html", "verbatim": "Daniel Brenner said: \"and there's really no consensus across the country or the medical community which approach is right yet because this disease has only been studied for two months,\"", "paraphrase": "Daniel Brenner said that experts nationwide and in the medical field still disagree on the best course of action, since the illness has been under study for just two months.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-04-01T19:14:02", "domain": "breitbart.com", "url": "http://www.breitbart.com/news/what-doctors-are-learning-about-covid-19-on-the-fly/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-04-01T19:14:02", "domain": "breitbart.com", "url": "http://www.breitbart.com/news/what-doctors-are-learning-about-covid-19-on-the-fly/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-03-012427", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-03-012427", "2020-02-05-014274", "2020-02-04-013596"], "speaker": "Rodrigo Duterte", "quotation": "China has been kind to us, we can only also show the same favour to them. Stop this xenophobia thing,", "n_domains": 6, "as_of": "2020-02-03T23:38:59", "query_url": "http://www.gulf-times.com/story/654973/Duterte-says-xenophobia-against-Chinese-must-stop#section_188", "verbatim": "Rodrigo Duterte said: \"China has been kind to us, we can only also show the same favour to them. Stop this xenophobia thing,\"", "paraphrase": "Duterte said that China had been kind to the Philippines and that Filipinos should return the same goodwill to Chinese people, urging an end to xenophobic sentiment against them.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-03T15:46:04", "domain": "morungexpress.com", "url": "http://morungexpress.com/philippines-duterte-says-xenophobia-against-chinese-must-stop", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-03T15:46:04", "domain": "morungexpress.com", "url": "http://morungexpress.com/philippines-duterte-says-xenophobia-against-chinese-must-stop"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-07-041068", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-07-041068", "2020-03-07-018762", "2020-03-22-042198", "2020-03-07-041067"], "speaker": "Meg Lanning", "quotation": "We're not coming just to put on a good show. We're coming here to win and that's the attitude we're going in with. It's been a long time coming and the build-up to the game is something I've not experienced before. It will be the biggest moment of my career,", "n_domains": 8, "as_of": "2020-03-07T16:15:00", "query_url": "https://www.telegraph.co.uk/cricket/2020/03/07/womens-t20-world-cup-final-australia-india-line-record-breaking/", "verbatim": "Meg Lanning said: \"We're not coming just to put on a good show. We're coming here to win and that's the attitude we're going in with. It's been a long time coming and the build-up to the game is something I've not experienced before. It will be the biggest moment of my career,\"", "paraphrase": "Meg Lanning said her side had not travelled simply to entertain spectators but had come to claim victory and was entering the contest with that mindset, while describing the run-up to the match as unlike anything she had previously experienced and calling it the most significant moment of her career.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-07T07:35:04", "domain": "news18.com", "url": "https://www.news18.com/cricketnext/news/icc-t20-world-cup-australia-practising-against-slow-spinners-to-tackle-indias-attack-2529461.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-07T07:35:04", "domain": "news18.com", "url": "https://www.news18.com/cricketnext/news/icc-t20-world-cup-australia-practising-against-slow-spinners-to-tackle-indias-attack-2529461.html"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-10-006650", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-10-006650", "2020-03-10-012598", "2020-03-11-012994", "2020-03-10-012596", "2020-03-10-006649", "2020-03-10-070420", "2020-03-10-006648", "2020-03-16-012690", "2020-03-10-050136", "2020-02-29-006499", "2020-03-11-012995", "2020-03-10-012597", "2020-03-14-030836"], "speaker": "Miley Ray Cyrus", "quotation": "Australia: Due to the recommendations of local, state, federal and international government authorities, including the Centers for Disease Control, to reduce potential health risks in response to the current global health crisis, we are no longer traveling to Aus for the show,", "n_domains": 10, "as_of": "2020-03-10T01:14:54", "query_url": "http://www.eonline.com/news/1129521/coachella-2020-music-festival-likely-to-be-postponed-over-coronavirus-concerns", "verbatim": "Miley Ray Cyrus said: \"Australia: Due to the recommendations of local, state, federal and international government authorities, including the Centers for Disease Control, to reduce potential health risks in response to the current global health crisis, we are no longer traveling to Aus for the show,\"", "paraphrase": "Miley Cyrus said she was cancelling her trip to Australia for the show because health officials at all levels of government, from local to international, including the CDC, had recommended measures to limit possible health risks amid a worldwide health crisis.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-29T01:55:57", "domain": "centraltelegraph.com.au", "url": "http://www.centraltelegraph.com.au/news/miley-cancels-bushfire-relief-concert/3964246/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-29T01:55:57", "domain": "centraltelegraph.com.au", "url": "http://www.centraltelegraph.com.au/news/miley-cancels-bushfire-relief-concert/3964246/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-30-109948", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-30-109948"], "speaker": "Michael Ryan", "quotation": "We, as WHO believe that these chains of transmission can still be interrupted. This disease is spreading from person-to-person through personal contact between individuals.", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-01-31T05:01:28", "query_url": "http://www.globalsecurity.org/security/library/news/2020/01/sec-200130-voa04.htm", "verbatim": "Michael Ryan said: \"We, as WHO believe that these chains of transmission can still be interrupted. This disease is spreading from person-to-person through personal contact between individuals.\"", "paraphrase": "Michael Ryan said WHO believed the chains of transmission could still be broken, adding that the disease spreads from person to person through personal contact between individuals.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-30T12:33:19", "domain": "voanews.com", "url": "https://www.voanews.com/science-health/coronavirus-outbreak/who-world-needs-be-alert-dangers-posed-coronavirus", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-30T12:33:19", "domain": "voanews.com", "url": "https://www.voanews.com/science-health/coronavirus-outbreak/who-world-needs-be-alert-dangers-posed-coronavirus"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-31-118630", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-31-118630", "2020-01-31-118629", "2020-01-31-118628"], "speaker": "Shoaib Akhtar", "quotation": "When Taylor hit Shami for a six in the first ball, I thought the match was over but that's where the experience of Shami came into play. He realized there was little bit of dew which will help the ball skid if he hits the length.", "n_domains": 7, "as_of": "2020-01-31T09:53:22", "query_url": "http://timesnow.tv/sports/cricket/article/shoaib-akhtar-heaps-praise-on-india-pacer-mohammed-shami-says-he-is-the-best-fast-bowler-in-world/547592", "verbatim": "Shoaib Akhtar said: \"When Taylor hit Shami for a six in the first ball, I thought the match was over but that's where the experience of Shami came into play. He realized there was little bit of dew which will help the ball skid if he hits the length.\"", "paraphrase": "Shoaib Akhtar said he had assumed the contest was finished after Taylor struck Shami for a six off the opening delivery, but Shami's experience came to the fore, as he noticed that some dew would help the ball skid if he bowled a full length.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-31T03:30:52", "domain": "hindustantimes.com", "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/cricket/find-of-india-the-best-fast-bowler-of-world-shoaib-akhtar-s-highest-praise-for-india-quick/story-n5eTtxz75xgK3RggmMbADN.html", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-31T03:30:52", "domain": "hindustantimes.com", "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/cricket/find-of-india-the-best-fast-bowler-of-world-shoaib-akhtar-s-highest-praise-for-india-quick/story-n5eTtxz75xgK3RggmMbADN.html"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-02-19-017036", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-02-19-017036"], "speaker": "Kate Orff", "quotation": "Even though gardening is listed in the top five hobbies of Americans, somehow we've not translated that into care for our environment. We need to try to somehow do a better job of bridging the divide between personal gardens and the larger global situation. It's all connected,", "n_domains": 9, "as_of": "2020-02-21T00:59:19", "query_url": "http://www.dcourier.com/news/2020/feb/20/landscape-architects-shift-emphasis-ecosystem/", "verbatim": "Kate Orff said: \"Even though gardening is listed in the top five hobbies of Americans, somehow we've not translated that into care for our environment. We need to try to somehow do a better job of bridging the divide between personal gardens and the larger global situation. It's all connected,\"", "paraphrase": "Kate Orff said that although gardening ranks among the five most popular hobbies in the country, Americans have failed to turn that interest into concern for the environment, and she argued that people must find better ways to link their backyard plots with broader global problems, adding that everything is interconnected.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-02-19T07:21:59", "domain": "washingtontimes.com", "url": "http://www.washingtontimes.com/news/2020/feb/19/landscape-architects-shift-emphasis-to-the-ecosyst/", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-02-19T07:21:59", "domain": "washingtontimes.com", "url": "http://www.washingtontimes.com/news/2020/feb/19/landscape-architects-shift-emphasis-to-the-ecosyst/"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-03-10-047235", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-03-10-047235", "2020-03-10-047234"], "speaker": "Evangelos Marinakis", "quotation": "Our home match with Olympiacos in the Europa League was played on Thursday 27th February and none of our staff who came into contact with him on that matchday have reported any symptoms since,", "n_domains": 63, "as_of": "2020-03-10T19:56:32", "query_url": "http://www.expressandstar.com/sport/uk-sports/2020/03/10/efl-no-immediate-plans-to-delay-games-after-forest-owner-contracts-coronavirus/", "verbatim": "Evangelos Marinakis said: \"Our home match with Olympiacos in the Europa League was played on Thursday 27th February and none of our staff who came into contact with him on that matchday have reported any symptoms since,\"", "paraphrase": "Marinakis said his side's home game against Olympiacos, a Europa League tie, had been played on Thursday, February 27, and that none of the staff who had been in contact with him that day had since reported any symptoms.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-03-10T13:55:22", "domain": "goal.com", "url": "https://www.goal.com/en/news/arsenal-issue-statement-after-olympiacos-owner-tests/l7dlp793hdyf1w8niasuaaao3", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-03-10T13:55:22", "domain": "goal.com", "url": "https://www.goal.com/en/news/arsenal-issue-statement-after-olympiacos-owner-tests/l7dlp793hdyf1w8niasuaaao3"}}
{"quote_id": "2020-01-10-106257", "split": "test", "variant_ids": ["2020-01-10-106257"], "speaker": "Aaron Finch", "quotation": "With everyone affected by bush fires around Australia, cricket is insignificant to what's happening there,", "n_domains": 5, "as_of": "2020-01-11T04:08:09", "query_url": "http://dunyanews.tv/index.php/en/Cricket/527379-Australia-Finch-expects-thrilling-Labuschagne-Bumrah-duel", "verbatim": "Aaron Finch said: \"With everyone affected by bush fires around Australia, cricket is insignificant to what's happening there,\"", "paraphrase": "Aaron Finch said that, with everyone affected by the bushfires across Australia, cricket was insignificant compared with what was happening there.", "gt_first_any": {"date": "2020-01-10T06:04:00", "domain": "iol.co.za", "url": "http://www.iol.co.za/sport/cricket/international/australias-finch-expects-thrilling-labuschagne-v-bumrah-duel-40364855", "has_time": true}, "gt_first_original": {"date": "2020-01-10T06:04:00", "domain": "iol.co.za", "url": "http://www.iol.co.za/sport/cricket/international/australias-finch-expects-thrilling-labuschagne-v-bumrah-duel-40364855"}}
